Cameras inside the 'ice cube' captured the dramatic moment for a new series called The Polar Bear Family and Me, which starts on Monday 7 January on BBC Two.
Check out the video above to see Gordon coming face to face with the polar bear.
Summary:Wildlife cameraman Gordon Buchanan was recently face-to-face with a polar bear in the Arctic while sitting in a special "ice cube" designed to protect him. Despite the bear's attempts, the "ice cube" held up and the encounter was captured on camera for a new BBC series.
, slice_answer: Wildlife cameraman Gordon Buchanan was recently face-to-face with a polar bear in the Arctic while sitting in a special "ice cube" designed to protect him. Despite the bear's attempts, the "ice cube" held up and the encounter was captured on camera for a new BBC series.
