Italy hopes the fair, covering a one million sq m (10.7m sq ft) site, will attract some 20 million visitors and generate revenues of about $10bn (Â£5.6bn; â‚¬8.9bn).
Summary:Milan has kicked off the Expo food fair, hoping it will attract 20 million visitors and generate billions of dollars in revenue.
